usage: launch.py [-h] --authorization AUTHORIZATION --authorization-sha
                 AUTHORIZATION_SHA --binding BINDING --binding-sha BINDING_SHA
                 --output OUTPUT --launch-directory LAUNCH_DIRECTORY

Whole 1800-second process-group envelope. Requires later explicit
authorization.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --authorization AUTHORIZATION
  --authorization-sha AUTHORIZATION_SHA
  --binding BINDING
  --binding-sha BINDING_SHA
  --output OUTPUT
  --launch-directory LAUNCH_DIRECTORY
